<h2 style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #2a2050; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700;">A passkey was added 🧵</h2>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #2a2050;">Hi <%= @user.first_name %>,</p>

<p style="margin: 0 0 16px 0; color: #2a2050;">A passkey named <strong><%= @passkey_name %></strong> was added to your Patchwork Labs account. It can now sign in to your account without an email link.</p>

<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin: 8px 0 24px 0;">
  <tr>
    <td style="border-radius: 8px; background-color: #6c3ec1;">
      <a href="<%= @passkeys_url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 12px 28px; background-color: #6c3ec1; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 8px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; font-family: 'Geist', -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;">
        Manage passkeys
      </a>
    </td>
  </tr>
</table>

<div style="margin-top: 32px; padding-top: 16px; border-top: 1px solid #ebe3f9; color: #5d5584; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">
  <p style="margin: 0;">If you didn't add this passkey, remove it from your profile, sign out of your other sessions, and contact an administrator.</p>
</div>
